{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111056","id":2872766249,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6rOu8p","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111056","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111056.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111056.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111056","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111056/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111056/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111056/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e0eff54162471458e21ae3200712f3580f5ad078","number":111056,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add PipeWire audio driver","user":{"login":"j20001970","id":71766835,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzY2ODM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71766835?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970","html_url":"https://github.com/j20001970","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10723\r\n\r\nThis PR adds PipeWire audio driver for linuxbsd platform.\r\n\r\n## Distro support\r\nThis PR expects PipeWire version 1.0.0 or higher. Here is the non-exhaustive list of minimum Linux distribution version required for the driver to work.\r\n<table>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <th>Name</th>\r\n    <th><code>libpipewire-0.3.so</code> version</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <th>Alpine v3.19</th>\r\n    <th><a href=\"https://pkgs.alpinelinux.org/package/v3.19/community/x86_64/pipewire\">1.0.0</a></th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <th>Debian 13</th>\r\n    <th><a href=\"https://packages.debian.org/trixie/pipewire\">1.4.2</a></th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <th>Fedora 38</th>\r\n    <th>1.0.3</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <th>openSUSE Leap 15.6</th>\r\n    <th><a href=\"https://download.opensuse.org/distribution/leap/15.6/repo/oss/x86_64/libpipewire-0_3-0-1.0.5+git36.60deeb2-150600.1.3.x86_64.rpm\">1.0.5</a></th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <th>Ubuntu 24.04 LTS</th>\r\n    <th><a href=\"https://packages.ubuntu.com/noble/pipewire\">1.0.5</a></th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n## How to test the driver\r\nThe new PipeWire audio driver does not take precedence over existing PulseAudio driver at the moment. You can change `audio/driver/driver` to \"PipeWire\" in Project Settings, or use `--audio-driver PipeWire` arguments to test the driver.\r\n\r\n## Vendored PipeWire headers\r\nThis PR introduces new thirdparty headers to enable PipeWire support. A brief list of added PipeWire and SPA headers **as of version 1.0.0** (the list may change if we update the headers in future) is documented to give a better grasp on how these headers are included (no pun intended).\r\n\r\n```\r\nRequired by \"pipewire/pipewire.h\":\r\n|───\"pipewire/array.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/client.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/conf.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/context.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/device.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/buffers.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/core.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/factory.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/keys.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/log.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/loop.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/link.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/main-loop.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/map.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/mem.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/module.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/node.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/properties.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/proxy.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/permission.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/protocol.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/port.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/stream.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/filter.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/thread-loop.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/data-loop.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/type.h\"\r\n|───\"pipewire/utils.h\"\r\n└───\"pipewire/version.h\"\r\n\r\nSPA headers required by PipeWire:\r\n|───\"spa/buffer/buffer.h\"\r\n|   └───\"spa/buffer/meta.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/node/command.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/node/io.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/node/node.h\"\r\n|   └───\"spa/node/event.h\"\r\n|       └───\"spa/pod/event.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/param/param.h\"\r\n|   |───\"spa/param/buffers.h\"\r\n|   |───\"spa/param/port-config.h\"\r\n|   |───\"spa/param/profile.h\"\r\n|   └───\"spa/param/route.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/pod/command.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/pod/pod.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/support/log.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/support/loop.h\"\r\n|   └───\"spa/support/system.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/support/plugin.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/support/thread.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/utils/defs.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/utils/dict.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/utils/hook.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/utils/list.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/utils/string.h\"\r\n└───\"spa/utils/type.h\"\r\n\r\nHeaders required by `AudioDriverPipeWire`:\r\n|───\"spa/param/audio/raw.h\" <- for SPA_AUDIO_FORMAT_* and SPA_AUDIO_CHANNEL_* enum\r\n|───\"spa/param/format.h\" <- for SPA_FORMAT_AUDIO_* enum\r\n|───\"spa/pod/builder.h\" <- for spa pod builder related functions and macros\r\n|   |───\"spa/pod/iter.h\"\r\n|   └───\"spa/pod/vararg.h\"\r\n|───\"spa/pod/parser.h\" <- for spa_pod_parse_object\r\n└───\"spa/utils/keys.h\"\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","f